        "description": "<p>This feature layer displays the locations of publicly operated riverports in Kentucky. Most ports are actively operating, while some are still in development. The operational status is indicated in the Op_Status field. Active ports are mapped at their physical operational sites, while developing ports are shown at their office locations if they lack a functional site near a waterway. This dataset supports transportation planning, logistics, and economic development.</p><p>Data Download: <a target='_blank' href='https://ky.app.box.com/s/x19a1nt03fmeihifoqmob46udmnpauiu' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>https://ky.app.box.com/s/x19a1nt03fmeihifoqmob46udmnpauiu</a></p>",
